  "description": "Two years ago, Gyudam broke up with Myungjin because he was enlisting in the military. They run into each other again by chance at school, but because of ghosts, Gyudam doesn’t recognize Myungjin. Shocked that his hyung has completely forgotten him, Myungjin gets into a traffic accident and, in an out-of-body state, appears again in front of Gyudam, who can see ghosts…\n\n*“What if I pass on without ever getting to put mine inside you, hyung?!”*\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/ExNoCism)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/ExNoCism)",
